e min-h-[52px] text-base\">Join Your Team</button></a><a class=\"block\" href=\"/parent/join\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl font-semibold ring-offset-bg transition-all duration-200 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:scale-[0.98] border bg-transparent hover:bg-[#EFF6FF] h-12 px-7 w-full font-athletic uppercase tracking-wide min-h-[52px] text-base border-[#CBD5E1] text-slate-900\">Parent Access</button></a><a class=\"block\" href=\"/waitlist\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl font-semibold ring-offset-bg transition-all duration-200 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:scale-[0.98] border bg-transparent h-12 px-7 text-base w-full border-slate-300 text-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-50 min-h-[48px]\">Coach or school access</button></a><a class=\"block\" href=\"/login\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl font-semibold ring-offset-bg transition-all duration-200 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:scale-[0.98] border bg-transparent h-12 min-h-[48px] px-7 text-base w-full border-slate-300 text-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-50\">Sign In</button></a></div></div><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-[#F8FAFC] via-white to-white pt-16 pb-10 md:pt-24 md:pb-14\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"absolute -top-24 -left-24 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-[#3B82F6]/10 blur-3xl\"></div><div class=\"absolute -bottom-24 -right-24 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-[#60A5FA]/10 blur-3xl\"></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10 text-center max-w-3xl\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-athletic font-bold text-[#212529] uppercase tracking-tight mb-6\">Why Braik</h1><p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-[#212529]/85 leading-relaxed\">Braik gives football programs one connected system for communication, scheduling, rosters, playbooks, video, and AI-powered support.</p><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-10 gap-y-4 border-y border-slate-200/80 py-6 text-sm md:text-base font-medium text-[#334155]\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#3B82F6]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Fewer disconnected tools</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#3B82F6]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Less admin overhead</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#3B82F6]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Built for real programs</span></div></div></section><section id=\"problem\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 py-14 md:py-20 bg-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mb-10 md:mb-12\"><h2 class=\"mb-3 font-athletic text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-900 md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl\">The problem with disconnected tools</h2><p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700 md:text-lg\">Most programs are forced to piece together multiple tools for messaging, scheduling, payments, documents, and film. That creates unnecessary cost, confusion, and extra work.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3 max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"relative rounded-xl border p-6 md:p-8 transition-all duration-300 border-slate-200/90 bg-white text-slate-700 shadow-sm [&amp;_p]:text-slate-700 [&amp;_li]:text-slate-700 [&amp;_strong]:text-slate-900 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#3B82F6]/35 hover:-translate-y-0.5\"><h3 class=\"font-athletic text-lg uppercase tracking-wide md:text-xl pr-2 mb-4 text-slate-900 font-semibold\">Rising costs</h3><div class=\"space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700\"><p>Multiple subscriptions and overlapping tools add up—often without a single source of truth for your program.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative rounded-xl border p-6 md:p-8 transition-all duration-300 border-slate-200/90 bg-white text-slate-700 shadow-sm [&amp;_p]:text-slate-700 [&amp;_li]:text-slate-700 [&amp;_strong]:text-slate-900 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#3B82F6]/35 hover:-translate-y-0.5\"><h3 class=\"font-athletic text-lg uppercase tracking-wide md:text-xl pr-2 mb-4 text-slate-900 font-semibold\">Fragmented communication</h3><div class=\"space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700\"><p>When messages and updates live in different places, staff, players, and families get mixed signals.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative rounded-xl border p-6 md:p-8 transition-all duration-300 border-slate-200/90 bg-white text-slate-700 shadow-sm [&amp;_p]:text-slate-700 [&amp;_li]:text-slate-700 [&amp;_strong]:text-slate-900 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#3B82F6]/35 hover:-translate-y-0.5\"><h3 class=\"font-athletic text-lg uppercase tracking-wide md:text-xl pr-2 mb-4 text-slate-900 font-semibold\">Duplicated work</h3><div class=\"space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700\"><p>The same data gets entered again and again across apps, burning time coaches do not have.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative rounded-xl border p-6 md:p-8 transition-all duration-300 border-slate-200/90 bg-white text-slate-700 shadow-sm [&amp;_p]:text-slate-700 [&amp;_li]:text-slate-700 [&amp;_strong]:text-slate-900 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#3B82F6]/35 hover:-translate-y-0.5\"><h3 class=\"font-athletic text-lg uppercase tracking-wide md:text-xl pr-2 mb-4 text-slate-900 font-semibold\">Parent/player confusion</h3><div class=\"space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700\"><p>Families should not need a map to figure out where schedules, fees, and announcements actually live.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative rounded-xl border p-6 md:p-8 transition-all duration-300 border-slate-200/90 bg-white text-slate-700 shadow-sm [&amp;_p]:text-slate-700 [&amp;_li]:text-slate-700 [&amp;_strong]:text-slate-900 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#3B82F6]/35 hover:-translate-y-0.5\"><h3 class=\"font-athletic text-lg uppercase tracking-wide md:text-xl pr-2 mb-4 text-slate-900 font-semibold\">Too many logins</h3><div class=\"space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700\"><p>Every extra system is another password, another link, and another place something falls through the cracks.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative rounded-xl border p-6 md:p-8 transition-all duration-300 border-slate-200/90 bg-white text-slate-700 shadow-sm [&amp;_p]:text-slate-700 [&amp;_li]:text-slate-700 [&amp;_strong]:text-slate-900 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#3B82F6]/35 hover:-translate-y-0.5\"><h3 class=\"font-athletic text-lg uppercase tracking-wide md:text-xl pr-2 mb-4 text-slate-900 font-semibold\">More admin stress</h3><div class=\"space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700\"><p>Coaches end up managing software instead of running the program—and small staffs feel it first.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"difference\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 py-14 md:py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#F8FAFC]/80 to-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mb-10 md:mb-12\"><h2 class=\"mb-3 font-athletic text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-900 md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl\">What Braik does differently</h2><p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700 md:text-lg\">Braik brings the moving parts of your program into one platform so your staff can spend less time managing software and more time coaching.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3 max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"relative rounded-xl border p-6 md:p-8 transition-all duration-300 border-slate-200/90 bg-white text-slate-700 shadow-sm [&amp;_p]:text-slate-700 [&amp;_li]:text-slate-700 [&amp;_strong]:text-slate-900 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#3B82F6]/35 hover:-translate-y-0.5\"><h3 class=\"font-athletic text-lg uppercase tracking-wide md:text-xl pr-2 mb-4 text-slate-900 font-semibold\">Scheduling &amp; calendars</h3><div class=\"space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700\"><p>Keep practices, games, and key dates organized in one place your program can actually rely on.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative rounded-xl border p-6 md:p-8 transition-all duration-300 border-slate-200/90 bg-white text-slate-700 shadow-sm [&amp;_p]:text-slate-700 [&amp;_li]:text-slate-700 [&amp;_strong]:text-slate-900 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#3B82F6]/35 hover:-translate-y-0.5\"><h3 class=\"font-athletic text-lg uppercase tracking-wide md:text-xl pr-2 mb-4 text-slate-900 font-semibold\">Team communication</h3><div class=\"space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700\"><p>Announcements, threads, and role-aware messaging that match how football programs are structured.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative rounded-xl border p-6 md:p-8 transition-all duration-300 border-slate-200/90 bg-white text-slate-700 shadow-sm [&amp;_p]:text-slate-700 [&amp;_li]:text-slate-700 [&amp;_strong]:text-slate-900 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#3B82F6]/35 hover:-translate-y-0.5\"><h3 class=\"font-athletic text-lg uppercase tracking-wide md:text-xl pr-2 mb-4 text-slate-900 font-semibold\">Payments &amp; dues</h3><div class=\"space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700\"><p>Collect and track payments with less back-and-forth—without sending families to yet another portal.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative rounded-xl border p-6 md:p-8 transition-all duration-300 border-slate-200/90 bg-white text-slate-700 shadow-sm [&amp;_p]:text-slate-700 [&amp;_li]:text-slate-700 [&amp;_strong]:text-slate-900 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#3B82F6]/35 hover:-translate-y-0.5\"><h3 cla